spice
* NMOS and PMOS model definitions
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS

* Transistor declarations
M00 4 2 3 3 PMOS
M2 4 1 3 3 NMOS
M1 4 9 3 3 NMOS

* Current sources
I1 8 4 DC 1
I2 5 3 DC 1
I3 4 1 DC 1
Iss 2 3 DC 1

* Capacitor
Cc 4 4 1p

* Voltage source
VDD 8 0 DC 5

* Nodes
.names Vout 4
.names Vb 1
.names X 4
.names P 9

.end